      "category": "etymology",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "text": "On September 20, 1777, General Charles Grey launched the surprise “no‑flint” attack on a Patriot encampment near Paoli, an event known as the Battle of Paoli.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        27,
        28,
        29,
